{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 6. Next steps\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab {\b Run the block protocol on this 50-task pool} \u8212- {\f1 deployment_game.py}, for {\f1 pbt} and {\f1 pbt_ceiling}. Already built, already validated on 40 of these tasks.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab {\b Three to five more runs.} The +0.023 needs about eight runs to clear zero; we have five. 70\u8211-110 minutes, no code changes.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab {\b A graded PBT score.} The largest single lever on the result.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab {\b Fewer unusable property suites.} Two-thirds of the coverage loss is the model writing something unrunnable.\sa180\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
